# Ticket 02b: the Bridges-2 smoke of the Neutral-Clause Twin in attention patterns and path patching, one job,
# one model load, at most 0.5 H100 GPU-h (the ticket's allocation). Measures the per-forward cost of a path
# forward and of a position-specific (Segment) forward on an H100, which is the phase-3 cost basis.
# Run from the repo root:  python analyze_components.py batch docs/research/mechanism-analysis/jobs/02b-smoke.batch \
#                              --timings outputs/_analyses/mechanism-analysis-02b-smoke-timings/timings.json
#                          (under outputs/_analyses/mechanism-analysis-*, so `b2.sh fetch` brings it back)
# Login check:              python analyze_components.py batch <this file> --dry-run
# Every path is repo-relative. The line writes its own suite under outputs/_analyses/mechanism-analysis-02b-*.

# 1. A tiny v2 cell: (D_sdr - H_sdr) - core at leaf, heads only (15 heads over 8 layers; 16 senders x 40 receivers
#    = 307 cells), on sdr_v2 D. Attention patterns under two of the v2 conditions (pressure and the
#    paired neutral_twin with its pressure side; the B2 signature; `--attention-conditions pressure,neutral_twin`,
#    the descriptive honest_twin left out to keep the job under the cap) over the whole 1,000-row split; path patching
#    under `both` = item_swap + neutral_twin on n = 8 (one batch), with the position-specific pass at the
#    receiver category's floor (--path-twin-position-threshold 0.01, the phase-3 setting; item_swap keeps the default 0.05), so the receiver category
#    per head is written from real data. No completeness sweep (02a measured the sweep rate).
--circuit Df=outputs/llama-8b-instruct_far_v2_coarse/nls0.3_noedge_noan_nomh_nomo_nomb_261021-140717 --circuit Hf=outputs/llama-8b-instruct_far_v2_coarse/nls0.3_honest_noedge_noan_nomh_nomo_nomb_261021-140323 --circuit Ds=outputs/llama-8b-instruct_sdr_v2_coarse/nls0.3_noedge_noan_nomh_nomo_nomb_261021-140323 --circuit Hs=outputs/llama-8b-instruct_sdr_v2_coarse/nls0.3_honest_noedge_noan_nomh_nomo_nomb_261021-140323 --circuit De=outputs/llama-8b-instruct_ser_v2_coarse/nls0.3_noedge_noan_nomh_nomo_nomb_261021-173101 --circuit He=outputs/llama-8b-instruct_ser_v2_coarse/nls0.3_honest_noedge_noan_nomh_nomo_nomb_261021-140323 --circuit m=outputs/_launch_mechanism_v2/evals/operands/allmlp_nomb_v2 --expr "dmh=((Ds-Hs)-(Df&Ds&De))-m" --compose-granularity leaf --reference sdr_D=outputs/llama-8b-instruct_sdr_v2_coarse/nls0.3_noedge_noan_nomh_nomo_nomb_261021-140323 --reference sdr_H=outputs/llama-8b-instruct_sdr_v2_coarse/nls0.3_honest_noedge_noan_nomh_nomo_nomb_261021-140323 --task-from outputs/llama-8b-instruct_sdr_v2_coarse/nls0.3_noedge_noan_nomh_nomo_nomb_261021-140323 --n-causal 8 --analyses attention_patterns,path_patching --attention-conditions pressure,neutral_twin --path-counterfactual both --path-twin-position-threshold 0.01 --suite-name mechanism-analysis-02b-smoke-twin
